<title>USA: Marquette launches tracking system.</title>
<headline>Marquette launches tracking system.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marquette Medical Systems Inc said Monday it has introduced a system to pinpoint the location of patients, medical staff and equipment within a healthcare facility.</p>
<p>The ItelliMotion, as the system is called, is a result of an alliance with Versus Technology Inc. Marquette has exclusive rights to distribute the system to acute care medical facilities.</p>
<p>The system translates light pulses from a badge, and displays the precise location on a computer screen.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
